      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ witena gerædnes is, þæt abbodas ⁊ abbodissan heora agen lif rihtlice fadian ⁊ eac heora heorda wislice healdan</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the decree of the councillors is, that abbots and abbesses shall order their own lives aright, and also keep their flocks with wisdom,</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Not in D]</ab>
      </div>
